          <mxGeometry x="1000" y="720" width="65" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="leg" value="Key decisions&#xa;&#xa;• Money lives ONLY in Payments — one consistency boundary (transfers, ledger_request, agent balance, commission, dispute effects).&#xa;• DB per service; Redis per service. No shared DB. No per-pod Redis sidecar.&#xa;• Within a service, split Redis: evicting cache  vs  non-evicting locks / idempotency.&#xa;• Events over RabbitMQ: transactional outbox → at-least-once → idempotent consumers + DLQ. Never lose a money event.&#xa;• Notification = own deployment consuming the bus (not a sidecar); reads contact/prefs from User.&#xa;• Reporting (later) = read-only projections; never a source of truth for money." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;spacing=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#cccccc;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="835" width="560" height="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
